<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 19.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 19.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 19	Dec 18	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  246.920     245.560     237.040    4.17 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.400     304.910     303.640    0.58 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.730     158.360     165.490   -4.08 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.974	46.840	48.410   -2.97 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  412.700     411.500     366.280   12.67 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.445     141.100     147.886   -4.36 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.144	16.076	14.975    9.81 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.600     216.380     230.135   -5.88 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.886	 1.883	 1.939   -2.73 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.573	 1.573	 1.575   -0.13 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  185.070     184.200     206.030  -10.17 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
